+
+/// <summary>
+/// Acceptance tests for the schema soft delete (story 015, User Story 2: AC-8, AC-9).
+///
+/// Arrange = EF seeding through factories, Act = HTTP, Assert = DB re-read (with and without
+/// IgnoreQueryFilters) and the read endpoints.
